<string name="privacy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
<string name="privacy_heading_zero_tracking">No analytics, no ads, no tracking</string>
<string name="privacy_body_zero_tracking">KestrelVPN does not collect telemetry, crash reports, advertising IDs, or browsing history. There are zero third-party tracking SDKs in this app.</string>
<string name="privacy_heading_local_data">Stored only on your device</string>
<string name="privacy_body_local_data">Server lists, ping/speed scores, and your preferences are stored locally on your phone and excluded from cloud backups.</string>
<string name="privacy_heading_public_servers">Public proxy servers</string>
<string name="privacy_body_public_servers">Server configurations are fetched from the public subscription URL configured in Settings. Because public servers are operated by third parties, avoid sensitive logins such as banking while connected. When you tap the exit-IP check, the app asks api.ipify.org which IP it sees; connectivity checks contact Google and Cloudflare endpoints. Nothing else is sent.</string>
